    "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:07:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-24T15:07:18Z",
    "body": "I would prefer to decompose this feature into its essential components and support those. E.g. \n- Being able to type and/or display formatted numbers is a common ask even for regular number inputs. If we piggyback on `Intl` primitives, there is already stuff in there for handling currency.\n- Being able to display prefixes or suffixes is a common need for other types of number inputs as well (percentages, units, etc)\n- Alignment can already (?) be controlled with CSS\n\nA currency input could be useful if it would have conveniences specific to currencies (e.g. conversion) but I'd argue that's out of scope.",
